{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118426","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118426/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118426/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118426/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118426","id":4245746949,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc79EPUF","number":118426,"title":"Re-importing assets via the import pipeline breaks UID references, clutters the output with warnings","user":{"login":"caphindsight","id":10833413,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODMzNDEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10833413?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight","html_url":"https://github.com/caphindsight","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caphindsight/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-04-11T20:42:04Z","updated_at":"2026-04-14T11:29:38Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nAfaik, all versions since the UID file change are affected.\nTested on 4.6.2\n\n### System information\n\nn/a\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe advanced import settings menu lets users save resources (e.g. meshes, animations, etc.) in a separate file.\nThe saved file will then be used from scenes.\n\nAfter changing and re-importing the original scene, the import pipeline replaces the saved file entirely and generates a new UID for it. This breaks all existing UID references.\n\nThe project doesn't break due to the fallback to the `res://` paths. However, this leads to persistent warnings about UID references on startup.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Import a 3d scene (from e.g. an `fbx` file or a `glb` file etc.).\n2. Double-click the file to open advanced import settings.\n3. Select a mesh or an animation, and enable \"save to file\" (give it a file path), then click reimport.\n4. Close Godot.\n5. Change the original `fbx` (or `glb`) file, e.g. by re-exporting it from a Blender project.\n6. Open Godot and open the project again.\n7. You should get a startup warning about the missing UID.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118426/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118426/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}